ew-chapter-in-unlocking-the-value-of-deadstock\",\"first_publication_date\":\"2026-06-12T15:04:03+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-06-19T09:12:43+0000\",\"uid\":\"nona-source-celebrates-its-fifth-anniversary-and-opens-a-new-chapter-in-unlocking-the-value-of-deadstock\",\"data\":{\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"Nona Source celebrates its fifth anniversary and opens a new chapter in unlocking the value of deadstock\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"To mark its fifth anniversary, Nona Source is unveiling a new brand identity, a redesigned website, and an exclusive immersive event.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"coverImage\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2844,\"height\":1598},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aiwdTalQnVZVES6n_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-06-12%C3%A015.15.05.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aiwdTalQnVZVES6n\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2844,\"height\":1598},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aiwdTalQnVZVES6n_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-06-12%C3%A015.15.05.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aiwdTalQnVZVES6n\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2844,\"height\":1598},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aiwdTalQnVZVES6n_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-06-12%C3%A015.15.05.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aiwdTalQnVZVES6n\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2844,\"height\":1598},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aiwdTalQnVZVES6n_Captured%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran2026-06-12%C3%A015.15.05.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aiwdTalQnVZVES6n\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\"