eate personalized shopping experiences matched to individual aspirations. \",\"spans\":\"$2f9\"}\n2f7:[\"$2f8\"]\n2fc:[]\n2fb:{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Selective Retailing\",\"spans\":\"$2fc\"}\n2fa:[\"$2fb\"]\n2fe:{\"width\":2953,\"height\":1996}\n2ff:{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}\n301:{\"width\":2953,\"height\":1996}\n302:{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}\n300:{\"dimensions\":\"$301\",\"alt\":\"Decorative image\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/f9629d05-73d4-46af-b8a3-0ffea8912b82_Distrubution+Se%CC%81lective.png?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"Zjjl3REAACEAwKJ_\",\"edit\":\"$302\"}\n2fd:{\"dimensions\":\"$2fe\",\"alt\":\"Cove"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"r - Selective Retailing\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/f9629d05-73d4-46af-b8a3-0ffea8912b82_Distrubution+Se%CC%81lective.png?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"Zjjl3REAACEAwKJ_\",\"edit\":\"$2ff\",\"mobile\":\"$300\"}\n305:[]\n304:{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"This sector brings together businesses that share a commitment to excellence, along with a passion for culture, along with a distinctive art de vivre.\",\"spans\":\"$305\"}\n303:[\"$304\"]\n308:[]\n307:{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Other activities\",\"spans\":\"$308\"}\n306:[\"$307\"]\n30a:{\"width\":2362,\"height\":2000}\n30b:{\"x\":0,\"y\":-476,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"}\n30d:{\"width\":2362,\"height\":2953}\n30e:{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"}\n30c:{\"dimensions\":\"$30d\",\"alt\":\"Decorative image\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/966a3dc9-3099-4a17-b7f7-9fb125f924a9_Autres+Activite%CC%81s.jpg?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZjjkmxEAAB8AwKCm\",\"edit\":\"$30e\"}\n309:{\"dimensions\":\"$30a\",\"alt\":\"Cover - Other activities\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/966a3dc9-3099-4a17-b7f7-9fb125f924a9_Autres+Activite