-end yacht builder which continues the   prestigious Dutch shipbuilding tradition.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Royal Van Lent\",\"spans\":[]}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":620,\"height\":408},\"alt\":\"Cover - Royal Van Lent\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/d9a5b852-40a7-4efd-aef2-bd767c7274c0_RoyalVanLent_thumbnail.jpg?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZdxmcREAACQAkrks\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":620,\"height\":408},\"alt\":\"Thumbnail Royal Van lent\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/d9a5b852-40a7-4efd-aef2-bd767c7274c0_RoyalVanLent_thumbnail.jpg?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZdxmcREAACQAkrks\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"Royal Van Lent\"}]},{\"title\":\"B to B Maisons\",\"hideTitle\":false,\"links\":[]}]}}]}],\"pushs\":\"$undefined\",\"primaryLink\":{\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"},\"label\":\"$undefined\"},\"secondaryLinks\":[],\"tertiaryLinks\":[],\"title\":{\"label\":[{\"type\":\"heading3\",\"text\":\"MAISONS\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":7,\"type\":\"em\"}]}],\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZdcA4BAAACEAL5yf\",\"uid\":\"our-maisons\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"LVMH is home to 75 distinguished Maisons rooted in six different sectors. True to tradition, each of our brands builds on a specialty legacy while keeping an unwavering focus on the exquisite caliber of its products.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Our Maisons\",\"spans\":[]}],\"miniature_image\":{},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]}}}},\"displaySeoContent\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2c6\",null,{\"small\":\"$undefined\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"primary_link_Join_us\",\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"},\"label\":\"Join us\",\"sublevel\":{\"id\":\"ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS\",\"bottomLink\":{\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"},\"label\":\"$undefined\"},\"description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"With more than 75 prestigious Maisons covering six business sectors, LVMH offers boundless opportunities. Join us!\",\"spans\":[]}],\"links\":[{\"links\":[{\"id\":\"subnav_link_first_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_0\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZkXl4BAAACEAp7LC\",\"uid\":\"work-at-lvmh\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Our products spark dreams…and so do our talented people.  Our culture of excellence embodies the Group’s mission, The Art of Crafting Dreams.\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":114,\"end\":140,\"type\":\"em\"}]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Work at LVMH\",\"spans\":[]}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":4000,\"height\":2200},\"alt\":\"Cover - Working at LVMH\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/957606ff-b251-4c80-8411-987668636b0f_Cover-EVP-WEB_Paysage-HauteDef.jpg?auto=format,compress?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZjTBfREAACQAusmn\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":4000,\"height\":2200},\"alt\":\"Cover - Working at LVMH\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/957606ff-b251-4c80-8411-987668636b0f_Cover-EVP-WEB_Paysage-HauteDef.jpg?auto=format,compress?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZjTBfREAACQAusmn\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"Work at LVMH\"},{\"id\":\"subnav_link_first_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_1\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZiEb_hEAACYAsXn_\",\"uid\":\"discover-our-metiers\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"With more than 75 Maisons, six business sectors, a presence in 80 countries and over 500 skills that span the entire value chain – from sourcing raw materials and producing our products to selective retailing – LVMH offers an environment that’s every bit as amazing as your ambitions.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"DISCOVER OUR MÉTIERS\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":9,\"end\":20,\"type\":\"em\"}],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2592,\"height\":1408},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/7ff98db4-ecd8-450c-8429-a020816fa00e_marie-louise-metiers-retail.png?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"ZR_OZRIAACUAw3O6\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"Discover our Métiers\"},{\"id\":\"subnav_link_first_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_2\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZfhA9hEAACIAstn4\",\"uid\":\"people-gallery\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"talents\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Discover the People Gallery\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"miniature_image\":{},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"People Gallery\"}],\"title\":\"Your Journey at LVMH\"},{\"links\":[{\"id\":\"subnav_link_second_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_0\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"Zmg6HREAACgAF0Fs\",\"uid\":\"lvmh-metiers-dexcellence\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"LVMH’s Métiers d’Excellence encompass over 280 Creative, Craft and Client Experience métiers with unique savoir-faire that are indispensable to the success of the Group and our Maisons.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"LVMH Métiers d'Excellence\",\"spans\":[]}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1600},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aifTMAeQX7-eXAO__ZoUY5R5LeNNTwvqW_dac923af-3d93-40f9-9499-b6fee9eebe22_Module%2BSlider%2BHub-2.avif?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aifTMAeQX7-eXAO_\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1600},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aifTMAeQX7-eXAO__ZoUY5R5LeNNTwvqW_dac923af-3d93-40f9-9499-b6fee9eebe22_Module%2BSlider%2BHub-2.avif?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aifTMAeQX7-eXAO_\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"LVMH Métiers d'Excellence\"},{\"id\":\"subnav_link_second_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_1\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"Zj4gkREAACEAyCZB\",\"uid\":\"lvmh-graduate-programs\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"At LVMH, we have always been committed to supporting and empowering the next generations. With the goal of fueling the pipeline of the next generation of leaders of the Group and our Maisons, the LVMH graduate programs are designed specifically to serve as a launching pad for fresh graduates and professionals in the early stages of their careers.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading2\",\"text\":\"LVMH Graduate Programs\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":5,\"end\":22,\"type\":\"em\"}]}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":988,\"height\":421},\"alt\":\"Decorative image\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/c3bb3135-5e8b-40f4-a9c5-13704cadc10b_GRADUATE+PROGRAMS+Page+-+Header+Photo.jpg?auto=compress,format\",\"id\":\"Zij9YRAAAB8AEK8g\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"#fff\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":988,\"height\":1500},\"alt\":\"Decorative image\",\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/c3bb3135-5e8b-40f4-a9c5-13704cadc10b_GRADUATE+PROGRAMS+Page+-+Header+Photo.jpg?auto=compress,format\u0026rect=419,0,277,421\u0026w=988\u0026h=1500\",\"id\":\"Zij9YRAAAB8AEK8g\",\"edit\":{\"x\":-1492,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":3.5629453681710213,\"background\":\"#fff\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"Graduate Programs\"},{\"id\":\"subnav_link_second_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_2\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZvZ0LRMAAC4AZz2N\",\"uid\":\"inside-lvmh\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Attracting, developing, and engaging next generation talents at LVMH is vital for fueling a pipeline of passionate and qualified candidates for our Maisons and ensuring the Group's continued success.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"INSIDE LVMH\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":3298,\"height\":1850},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aeHvfp1ZCF7ETR4m_CoverINSIDELVMH.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aeHvfp1ZCF7ETR4m\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":3298,\"height\":1850},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/aeHvfp1ZCF7ETR4m_CoverINSIDELVMH.png?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"aeHvfp1ZCF7ETR4m\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"INSIDE LVMH\"},{\"id\":\"subnav_link_second_ZfRsyREAAB8AofLS_3\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZkfKmhAAACIAr65I\",\"uid\":\"dare-disrupt-act-risk-to-be-an-entrepreneur\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"DARE – Disrupt, Act, Risk to be an Entrepreneur – is the LVMH Group’s intrepreneurial program, launched in 2017.\",\"spans\":[]}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"DARE\",\"spans\":[]}],\"miniature_image\":{},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"DARE\"}],\"title\":\"Our programs\"}],\"pushs\":{\"title\":\"Highlight\",\"primary\":{\"push\":{\"id\":\"ae9mlxIAAC4An2nO\",\"uid\":\"11th-edition-of-the-lvmh-institut-des-metiers-dexcellences-master-games-discover-the-winners\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"news\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"tags\":[],\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Every year, French, Swiss, and Italian apprentices from the Institut des Métiers d’Excellence come together to tackle a shared challenge proposed by one of the Group’s Maison. In 2026, the Italian Master Games also celebrated the Italian art of living embodied by Acqua di Parma and invited students to reinterpret exceptional craftsmanship through unique projects.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"heading1\",\"text\":\"Generazioni d’Eccellenza: the initiative created by the Institut des Métiers d’Excellence is back in Italy to celebrate creativity and excellence with Master Games and the graduation ceremony of the students.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":8192,\"height\":5464},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ah2fCgeQX7-eWfuw_Groupfotostudents.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ah2fCgeQX7-eWfuw\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":8192,\"height\":5464},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/ah2fCgeQX7-eWfuw_Groupfotostudents.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"ah2fCgeQX7-eWfuw\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"}}},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"}},\"buttonLabel\":\"Learn more\"},\"simpleList\":\"$undefined\"},\"primaryLink\":{\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZfhAiBEAACAAstfH\",\"uid\":\"our-job-offers\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"offers\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Our Job Offers\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"miniature_image\":{},\"file\":\"$undefined\",\"buttonLink\":\"$undefined\"},\"tags\":[]},\"label\":\"$undefined\"},\"secondaryLinks\":[{\"id\":\"secondary_0\",\"label\":\"\",\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"}}],\"tertiaryLinks\":[{\"id\":\"tertiary_0\",\"label\":\"\",\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"}}],\"title\":{\"label\":[{\"type\":\"heading3\",\"text\":\"JOIN\",\"spans\":[]},{\"type\":\"heading3\",\"text\":\"US\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":2,\"type\":\"em\"}]}],\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"}}}},\"displaySeoContent\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-6 py-2 \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2c6\",null,{\"small\":\"$undefined\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"primary_link_Dream_Machine\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"ZhekgBEAACYAIMj6\",\"type\":\"hubMagazine\",\"tags\":[\"CACHE_TARGET_NEWS\"],\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"slug\":\"hub-magazine\",\"first_publication_date\":\"2024-04-11T08:51:18+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-06-12T15:26:02+0000\",\"uid\":\"dream-machine\",\"data\":{\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Dream Machine\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"A magazine that embodies our mission, The Art of Crafting Dreams, like \\\"fragments\\\" of dreams of the world of LVMH.\",\"spans\":[{\"start\":38,\"end\":64,\"type\":\"em\"}]}]},\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"key\":\"1630f98c-c03a-4261-87f6-4f6577e7ddde\",\"isBroken\":false},\"label\":\"Dream Machine\",\"sublevel\":\"$undefined\"},\"displaySeoContent\":true}]}]],[[\"$\",\"$L30f\",\"event-link-0\",{\"listItemClassNames\":\"pl-0 py-2 border-basic-greyUltraLight mt-auto border-y\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"event_link_LES_JOURNÉES_PARTICULIÈRES\",\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"},\"label\":\"LES JOURNÉES PARTICULIÈRES\",\"sublevel\":{\"id\":\"aeItMxEAACkAkeUl\",\"bottomLink\":{\"link\":{\"link_type\":\"Any\"},\"label\":\"$undefined\"},\"description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Les Journées Particulières take you to the Source of Dreams on October 16, 17 and 18, 2026!\\nCome and explore our iconic spaces, some of which are opening their doors to the public for the first time, and let our craftspeople take you on a voyage.\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"links\":[{\"links\":[{\"id\":\"subnav_aeItMxEAACkAkeUl_0\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"aenPyBIAACkAlyTF\",\"uid\":\"les-journees-particulieres-2026\",\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"type\":\"page\",\"link_type\":\"Document\",\"isBroken\":false,\"data\":{\"short_description\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Les Journées Particulières are back on 16, 17 and 18 October 2026! Embark on a discovery of emblematic places and let our artisans guide you on a journey \\\"At the Source of Dreams\\\".\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"pageTitle\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"Les Journées Particulières 2026\",\"spans\":[],\"direction\":\"ltr\"}],\"miniature_image\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":960,\"height\":640},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/afxGqMBOoF08xtMa_JP-41.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"afxGqMBOoF08xtMa\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zoom\":1,\"background\":\"transparent\"},\"mobile\":{\"dimensions\":{\"width\":960,\"height\":640},\"alt\":null,\"copyright\":null,\"url\":\"https://images.prismic.io/lvmh-com/afxGqMBOoF08xtMa_JP-41.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"id\":\"afxGqMBOoF08xtMa\",\"edit\":{\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"zo